    - target: {fileID: 2023707344181429463, guid: 409208cff23b95d4084a2f5083c76bd0, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'newDialogue.Array.data[1].dialogueText.Array.data[0]'
      value: Grab the Dusty Pistol and equip it into your loadout, your inventory
        can be accessed by pressing 'I'.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2023707344181429463, guid: 409208cff23b95d4084a2f5083c76bd0, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'newDialogue.Array.data[1].dialogueText.Array.data[1]'
      value: second line test
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2023707344181429463, guid: 409208cff23b95d4084a2f5083c76bd0, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'newDialogue.Array.data[1].dialogueText.Array.data[2]'
      value: The ship has been overrun by electricity consuming parasites, and we
        need your help to exterminate them.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2023707344181429463, guid: 409208cff23b95d4084a2f5083c76bd0, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'newDialogue.Array.data[2].dialogueClip.Array.data[0]'
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2023707344181429463, guid: 409208cff23b95d4084a2f5083c76bd0, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'newDialogue.Array.data[2].dialogueClip.Array.data[1]'
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2023707344181429463, guid: 409208cff23b95d4084a2f5083c76bd0, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'newDialogue.Array.data[2].dialogueText.Array.data[0]'
      value: We will need access to stronger weapons. Heres the location of the weapons
        manufacturing and research room.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2023707344181429463, guid: 409208cff23b95d4084a2f5083c76bd0, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'newDialogue.Array.data[2].dialogueText.Array.data[1]'
      value: You can see where this room is located by looking at your map, which
        can be opened by pressing 'M'.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2023707344181429463, guid: 409208cff23b95d4084a2f5083c76bd0, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'newDialogue.Array.data[2].dialogueText.Array.data[2]'
      value: Please allow me to be your guide, I can direct you to this ships main
        pieces of infrastructure that will give you access to new weapons and cybernetic
        upgrades
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2023707344181429463, guid: 409208cff23b95d4084a2f5083c76bd0, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'newDialogue.Array.data[2].dialogueText.Array.data[3]'
      value: These will prove to be necessary as the foe before us is no weak threat
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2023707344181429463, guid: 409208cff23b95d4084a2f5083c76bd0, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'newDialogue.Array.data[3].dialogueClip.Array.data[0]'
