      propertyPath: 'newDialogue.Array.data[3].dialogueClip.Array.data[3]'
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 8d01e07005f77634abdb1f9268483b78, type: 3}
    - target: {fileID: 2023707344181429463, guid: 409208cff23b95d4084a2f5083c76bd0, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'newDialogue.Array.data[3].dialogueClip.Array.data[4]'
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 8300000, guid: cfc38bffe50a7e14cb9799d4b930b1e9, type: 3}
    - target: {fileID: 2023707344181429463, guid: 409208cff23b95d4084a2f5083c76bd0, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'newDialogue.Array.data[3].dialogueText.Array.data[0]'
      value: Use your collected specimens to craft a new weapon. The crafting menu
        can be accessed remotely, first open your inventory, then open the Weapons
        tab.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2023707344181429463, guid: 409208cff23b95d4084a2f5083c76bd0, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'newDialogue.Array.data[3].dialogueText.Array.data[1]'
      value: Note that the Dusty Pistol can be replicated for free, ensuring you
        always have a weapon.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2023707344181429463, guid: 409208cff23b95d4084a2f5083c76bd0, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'newDialogue.Array.data[4].dialogueClip.Array.data[0]'
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2023707344181429463, guid: 409208cff23b95d4084a2f5083c76bd0, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'newDialogue.Array.data[4].dialogueClip.Array.data[1]'
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2023707344181429463, guid: 409208cff23b95d4084a2f5083c76bd0, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'newDialogue.Array.data[4].dialogueText.Array.data[0]'
      value: The parasites are gaining strength rapidly, we must be able to match
        their power.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2023707344181429463, guid: 409208cff23b95d4084a2f5083c76bd0, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'newDialogue.Array.data[4].dialogueText.Array.data[1]'
      value: Here is the location to the Cybernetics Room, which will give you access
        to permanent upgrades.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2023707344181429463, guid: 409208cff23b95d4084a2f5083c76bd0, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'newDialogue.Array.data[5].dialogueClip.Array.data[0]'
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2023707344181429463, guid: 409208cff23b95d4084a2f5083c76bd0, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'newDialogue.Array.data[5].dialogueClip.Array.data[1]'
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2023707344181429463, guid: 409208cff23b95d4084a2f5083c76bd0, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'newDialogue.Array.data[5].dialogueText.Array.data[0]'
      value: There are two forms of upgrades; Implants, and Cards.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2023707344181429463, guid: 409208cff23b95d4084a2f5083c76bd0, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'newDialogue.Array.data[5].dialogueText.Array.data[1]'
      value: Implants are used to upgrade your overall combat capabilties, which
        can be accessed by opening your inventory, then opening the Upgrade tab.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2023707344181429463, guid: 409208cff23b95d4084a2f5083c76bd0, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'newDialogue.Array.data[5].dialogueText.Array.data[2]'
      value: Cards are available in battle, and quickly upgrade your stats temporarily.
        These can be configured by opening your inventory, then opening the Cards
        tab.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2023707344181429463, guid: 409208cff23b95d4084a2f5083c76bd0, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'newDialogue.Array.data[5].dialogueText.Array.data[3]'
      value: To gain access to stronger weapons and upgrades, ensure to clear random
        infested rooms. These can be found using your navigation device.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2023707344181429463, guid: 409208cff23b95d4084a2f5083c76bd0, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'newDialogue.Array.data[5].dialogueText.Array.data[4]'
      value: Open your navigation device by opening your inventory, then open the
        Navigation tab. It is also used as a teleporter, to transport yourself to
        a distant location.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2023707344181429463, guid: 409208cff23b95d4084a2f5083c76bd0, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'newDialogue.Array.data[6].dialogueClip.Array.data[0]'
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2023707344181429463, guid: 409208cff23b95d4084a2f5083c76bd0, type: 3}
