      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2023707344181429463, guid: 409208cff23b95d4084a2f5083c76bd0, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'newDialogue.Array.data[6].dialogueClip.Array.data[2]'
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2023707344181429463, guid: 409208cff23b95d4084a2f5083c76bd0, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'newDialogue.Array.data[6].dialogueClip.Array.data[3]'
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2023707344181429463, guid: 409208cff23b95d4084a2f5083c76bd0, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'newDialogue.Array.data[6].dialogueText.Array.data[0]'
      value: To stop the parasites from re-infesting nearby rooms, we must activate
        the local power grid and close the security doors.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2023707344181429463, guid: 409208cff23b95d4084a2f5083c76bd0, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'newDialogue.Array.data[6].dialogueText.Array.data[1]'
      value: Clear the local power room and attempt to turn on the grid.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2023707344181429463, guid: 409208cff23b95d4084a2f5083c76bd0, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'newDialogue.Array.data[6].dialogueText.Array.data[2]'
      value: To gain access to stronger weapons and upgrades, ensure to clear random
        infested rooms. These can be found using your navigation device.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2023707344181429463, guid: 409208cff23b95d4084a2f5083c76bd0, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'newDialogue.Array.data[6].dialogueText.Array.data[3]'
